5,1,1,talk,Shizue,,I wonder if we should look at the staff survey first. It feels important to hear what everyone actually wants before moving anything.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Toshio,,"The survey shows preference, not consequence. We need to know who absorbs the noise and glare before we assign desks.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,I’m a bit worried about the budget. Can we check the floor billing basis? I want to know the real cost before deciding.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Mio,,I’m worried about losing my short gaps between meetings! Let’s check the morning routine upstairs to see how much time the changeover actually eats.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,Comfort is the only metric that actually matters for eight-hour stints. I’ll check the sound meter readings and the physio’s note.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
