11,1,2,talk,Toshio,,I will examine the unplanned seat shuffles and the arrival times. Patterns reveal who actually suffers the disruption.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,I’ll look into the facilities quote for re-running power and network. I need to see if the extra wiring fits our tight budget.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Mio,,I’ll also check the badge records for arrival times! I need to see exactly how those morning gaps get squeezed during the shuffle.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,I’m done. I’ve already picked my two. Let’s see what you all dig up before we waste more time.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
