35,2,1,talk,Shizue,,"I found the plan puts three desks against the wall, yet daylight was the top complaint. The new joiners also learned by overhearing.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Toshio,,"The shuffles dragged on for weeks. Badge data proves early arrivals claim the best spots. We must assign seats explicitly, not by habit.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,I found we pay for empty desks. The wiring quote is high too. We need to be careful with the budget.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Mio,,"Four to nine minutes per person! That’s huge. Plus, early birds grab the good spots before we even arrive. We need a fair system!","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Shunichi,,"Nine decibels louder by the printer, and chairs that take days to settle. I’m not moving to the noisy side.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Toshio, I agree. We must be deliberate. @Mio, those minutes add up. Let us ensure the layout supports our daily rhythm and well-being.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Toshio"",""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Shizue, precisely. The data confirms the bias. We must name who takes the worse seats, rather than letting the early arrivals decide by default.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@Toshio, I agree. But every move costs money. We must be very careful not to waste funds on unnecessary changes.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Mio,,"@Toshio, exactly! If we don’t assign seats, I lose my morning gaps. @Daisuke, please, let’s not let budget worries ruin our focus time!","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Toshio"",""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Mio, your gaps are a luxury. I need a quiet, ergonomic spot. @Daisuke, if the budget is tight, we keep the current chairs.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Mio"",""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Shizue,,"@Shunichi, I hear your need for quiet. But the joiners learned by listening. Perhaps we can balance your comfort with their growth?","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Toshio,,"@Shunichi, comfort is not the only variable. The badge data shows the early arrivals already hold the advantage. We must explicitly assign the burden to prevent further drift.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Daisuke,,"@Shunichi, I understand. But the wiring cost is high. We must minimize moves to save money.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Mio,,"@Shunichi, quiet is great, but my gaps are vital! @Toshio, let’s lock in specific times so nobody steals my morning focus.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Shunichi"",""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Shunichi,,"@Shizue, their growth isn’t my problem. @Toshio, I’m not absorbing your burden. I need the window side, or I’m resigning.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Shizue"",""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Shizue,,"@Shunichi, please, do not resign. I value your presence deeply. Let us find a gentle compromise that respects your need for quiet and the team’s needs.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Toshio,,"@Shunichi, resignation is not a negotiation tactic. The data shows the burden is already uneven. We must assign it explicitly, not let it fester.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Daisuke,,"I’m sorry, Shunichi. I don’t want you to leave. I’ll try to find a quiet spot that doesn’t cost too much.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Mio,,"@Shunichi, please don’t quit! I’ll take the noisy spot so you can have the window. I just need my morning gaps protected!","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Shunichi,,"@Mio, I appreciate the offer, but I won’t accept guilt-tripping. @Toshio, the window side is non-negotiable. Let’s finalize the layout based on acoustics, not sentiment.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Mio"",""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
